SUMMARY:Deadline 17:00 EST: City of Kitchener 2027 Artist in Residence (CAD
  10\,000 honorarium)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 03 Dec 2026 at 17:00 EST.\n\nThe City of Kitchener's 202
 7 Artist in Residence is a six-month\, part-time residency for a contempor
 ary artist working at the boundaries of writing\, academic or archival res
 earch and visual arts. The residency is tied to Parks and Open Space work:
  its themes will inform a later public art commission in the Lancaster par
 k network\, and the resident is expected to run community engagement.\n\nO
 rganisation: City of Kitchener\nLocation: Kitchener\, Ontario. For artists
  living or working in Waterloo Region or with a clear ongoing connection t
 o it.\nAward: CAD 10\,000 honorarium (two instalments) plus up to CAD 2\,5
 00 for pre-approved expenses. No application fee.\nDuration: Six months pa
 rt-time\, April to September/October 2027\n\nMore: https://www.kitchener.c
 a/AIRProposals?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.kitchener.ca/AIRProposals?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrant
 desk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Kitchener\, Ontario. For artists living or working in Waterloo Reg
 ion or with a clear ongoing connection to it.
